WhatsApp Clone - Django

A real-time WhatsApp Clone web application developed using Python, Django,
Django Channels, WebSocket, HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

Features

User authentication
One-to-one chat
Real-time messaging
Message delivery status
Read / unread message status
Online / offline presence
Unread message count
Add contacts
Delete contacts
Search users
Send image and video messages
Message notifications
Voice calling using WebRTC

Technologies Used
------------------
Backend

Python
Django
Django Channels
Daphne
SQLite

Frontend

HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript
WebSocket
WebRTC

